updater
*.log
.env
# A developer's local override must never reach the build context. `.env.local` is
# gitignored but was still copied in, so the image could bake a machine-specific API URL
# instead of using the same-origin /api proxy nginx.conf sets up. The Dockerfile's empty
# ARG wins over it, but relying on that precedence to save the build is fragile.
.env*.local
# Render-harness fixtures. These are fetched by src/__*_harness__.tsx only — never by app
# code — so shipping them would publish dev test data from the production image. Vite
# still serves them in dev straight out of public/, so excluding them here costs nothing.
public/anytype_connectors_fixture.json
